  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afe46c950e4801d44beb311b827ea6c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Prologue_Railway
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Style: 1
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_RAILWAY_01
    DefaultText: "오래전, 두 나라는\n철길로 연결되어 있었다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_RAILWAY_02
    DefaultText: "사람. 물건."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_RAILWAY_04
    DefaultText: "그리고 두 나라를\n오가던 소문들."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_RAILWAY_03
    DefaultText: "열차는 국경을 넘어,\n모든 것을 실어 날랐다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
